~ start
# Player finds lion billboards?
do Global.dim_lights(true)
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.narrator, true)
Narrator: But luckily, one day they were found by two kind and generous lions
Narrator: They took the little mouse in and raised them in their own home
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.narrator, false)
do Global.dim_lights(false)
